        <Page social="4" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] These Argons are giving me a headache...there's too many of them, and that buzzing noise!&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Will you help us eliminate them?&lt;br&gt;[ES] Estos argons me est&amp;#225;n dando dolor de cabeza... &amp;#161;hay demasiados y ese zumbido!&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&amp;#191;Nos ayudar&amp;#225;s a eliminarlos?</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="4" huntingZoneId="249" prevId="3" villagerId="2002">
        <Page social="4" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Thanks! You taught those Argons a lesson, that's for sure.&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Gracias! Les diste una lecci&amp;#243;n a esos argons, eso es seguro.</Page>
